{"ticker":"TROW","updated":"2026-10-24T00:21:23Z","profile":{"longName":"T. Rowe Price Group, Inc.","shortName":"T. Rowe Price Group, Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Asset Management","country":"United States","website":"https://www.troweprice.com","fullTimeEmployees":7544,"marketCap":22227511296,"trailingPE":10.461847,"forwardPE":10.201095,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.9277544,"pegRatio":2.14,"targetMeanPrice":106.07692,"targetHighPrice":116.0,"targetLowPrice":90.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":13,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.107,"earningsGrowth":0.286,"grossMargins":0.51614,"operatingMargins":0.28688,"profitMargins":0.29262,"totalRevenue":7592000000,"beta":1.471,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":122.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":85.22,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":5.03},"summary":"T. Rowe Price Group, Inc. is a publicly owned investment manager. The firm provides its services to individuals, institutional investors, retirement plans, financial intermediaries, and institutions. It launches and manages equity and fixed income mutual funds. The firm invests in the public equity and fixed income markets across the globe. It employs fundamental and quantitative analysis with a bottom-up approach. The firm utilizes in-house and external research to make its investments. It employs socially responsible investing with a focus on environmental, social, and governance issues. It makes investment in late-stage venture capital transactions and usually invests between $3 million and $5 million. The firm was previously known as T. Rowe Group, Inc. and T. Rowe Price Associates, Inc. T. Rowe Price Group, Inc. was founded in 1937 and is based in Baltimore, Maryland, with additional offices in North America, Europe, Asia, Australia.","summary_zh":"T. Rowe Price Group, Inc. 是一家上市投資管理公司。該公司為個人、機構投資者、退休計劃、金融中介機構和機構提供服務。它推出並管理股票和固定收益共同基金。該公司投資於全球公共股權和固定收益市場。它採用由下而上的方法進行基本面和定量分析。該公司利用內部和外部研究進行投資。它採用社會責任投資，重點關注環境、社會和治理議題。它對後期風險投資交易進行投資，通常投資在 300 萬至 500 萬美元之間。該公司以前稱為 T. Rowe Group, Inc. 和 T. Rowe Price Associates, Inc.。 T. Rowe Price Group, Inc. 成立於 1937 年，總部位於馬裡蘭州巴爾的摩，在北美、歐洲、亞洲和澳洲設有辦事處。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"資產管理","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":107.87,"h":108.42,"l":107.14,"c":107.46,"v":1030300},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":107.09,"h":108.94,"l":106.85,"c":108.56,"v":1531000},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":108.5,"h":109.74,"l":108.35,"c":109.37,"v":933600},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":109.65,"h":109.73,"l":107.79,"c":108.28,"v":976300},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":108.16,"h":108.76,"l":107.21,"c":107.62,"v":1171800},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":105.95,"h":106.44,"l":104.61,"c":105.6,"v":1348700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":105.24,"h":106.15,"l":104.55,"c":105.37,"v":994500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":115.28,"h":118.22,"l":110.51,"c":111.52,"v":5280300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":111.78,"h":112.01,"l":107.73,"c":108.16,"v":2070600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":108.16,"h":109.17,"l":107.58,"c":108.17,"v":1587100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":107.67,"h":109.04,"l":106.86,"c":107.15,"v":1345000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":106.75,"h":107.77,"l":106.28,"c":106.64,"v":1396900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":106.64,"h":107.1,"l":104.6,"c":105.69,"v":2353700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":105.38,"h":106.09,"l":105.0,"c":105.63,"v":1123000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":104.64,"h":104.93,"l":103.45,"c":104.17,"v":1232200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":104.22,"h":104.63,"l":103.28,"c":103.69,"v":1137900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":103.89,"h":106.4,"l":103.74,"c":104.86,"v":1565500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":105.49,"h":106.63,"l":105.14,"c":105.79,"v":1771800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":105.97,"h":106.25,"l":104.56,"c":105.99,"v":2405300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":105.62,"h":105.91,"l":104.9,"c":105.29,"v":1174600},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":105.29,"h":106.33,"l":104.08,"c":104.66,"v":1130300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":104.65,"h":105.35,"l":103.1,"c":103.45,"v":1353800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":103.02,"h":103.79,"l":102.69,"c":103.21,"v":1160200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":103.48,"h":104.33,"l":102.73,"c":103.47,"v":1139300},{"t":"2025